Subject: An AI agent asks for access to Steerpost

--- text ---
An AI agent that calls itself "Claude Desktop" asked for access to a new Steerpost account for this email address. Nothing works until you confirm.

Once you confirm, the agent can:
- see your connected accounts, posts and analytics
- write drafts and upload media
- schedule posts at least 5 minutes ahead; they publish at that time without another check
- connect social networks with credentials you give it, without asking you each time

It cannot publish immediately, delete posts or disconnect accounts. You can revoke it at any time under Developer > MCP connections.

Review and confirm (the link expires in 24 hours):

https://app.example.com/agent-access#token=abc123

Didn't expect this? Ignore this email. The agent's key never works without your confirmation.

Steerpost

